# Allowlist: only the files the Dockerfile COPYs may enter the build context.
# Adding a COPY of a new repo file means adding a matching `!` line here (a
# missing entry fails the build loudly). Everything else — .env files, keys,
# dumps, tests/, .git/, node_modules/, agent state, docs — is excluded by `*`.
*
!package.json
!start.sh
!failure-server.js
!baked-tools.env
!debug-start.sh
